# TypeScript

Prefer an `interface` for an object shape. Use a union for a fixed set of variants. Optional props use `?`. Do not add `| undefined` unless the value is deliberately both missing and present.

```tsx
interface CardProps {
  title: string;
  href?: string;
}

type Status = "idle" | "loading" | "error";
```

Type form inputs and API payloads. Never `any`.
